# Real capture, Phase 11a Task 9 (GH Actions real-linux run 39087535939,
# ubuntu-24.04): `tcpdump -i any udp port 53` (LINUX_SLL2) during
# dns_query_is_observed_and_alerts, SLL2 header stripped so lines start at L3.
# pcap packets #52-#61: curl's A + AAAA lookup of <marker>.xyz on lo
