# resolved's upstream queries to 168.63.129.16 (each seen twice, on ifindex 2
# and 3: one transaction each, the second copy is a duplicate), and the
# NXDOMAIN answers (with SOA authority + EDNS OPT). Expected order is the
# order the responses arrived. local_origin follows the capture's
# disposition: lo copies and OUTGOING packets are local, HOST on eth is not.
